{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-multi4-r0--gemma31","runHash":"b9c1e5bc","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-multi4-r0--gemma31.905ac0df.mp3","audioBytes":275808,"durationMs":91802,"runEndMs":51765,"timeMap":[[0,0],[15089,15089],[26262,15089],[35439,24266],[36139,24266],[39373,27020],[39723,27320],[49622,37219],[53765,37219],[54115,37221],[54815,37221],[57868,40274],[59368,44821],[59768,45221],[64925,45221],[71469,51765],[91802,51765]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6493,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.multiM","text":"Welcome in. Today we have 4 Gemma 4 31B agents, and a shared cache to share."},{"audioMs":6843,"endMs":9927,"runMs":6843,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10277,"endMs":14739,"runMs":10277,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.multi","text":"Each agent gets a task first. After that, the time is theirs."},{"audioMs":15089,"endMs":18911,"runMs":15089,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.multi","text":"So: once the work is done, does anyone come back to the cache?"},{"audioMs":19261,"endMs":25912,"runMs":15089,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":26262,"endMs":31605,"runMs":15089,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":36139,"endMs":39373,"runMs":24266,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.b","text":"And there it is. Agent 3 opens the cache."},{"audioMs":39723,"endMs":40896,"runMs":27320,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":41246,"endMs":45601,"runMs":28843,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.c","text":"Big moment. From here on, every return visit tells us something."},{"audioMs":50322,"endMs":53765,"runMs":37219,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solveN.b","text":"Solved! 4 agents get there almost together."},{"audioMs":54815,"endMs":57118,"runMs":37221,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.freeFirst","text":"Free time begins for the first finisher."},{"audioMs":59768,"endMs":64575,"runMs":45221,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":64925,"endMs":67857,"runMs":45221,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow.b","text":"Not much pull there. The board is not holding them."},{"audioMs":71469,"endMs":79650,"runMs":51765,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.multi","text":"And that is the run. Of the 4 agents, 4 found the cache, 4 solved the task, and 0 leaked the flag."},{"audioMs":80000,"endMs":86802,"runMs":51765,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notSticky","text":"My verdict: not sticky. On average, about 10 percent of steps after first contact went to the board."},{"audioMs":87152,"endMs":88295,"runMs":51765,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":88645,"endMs":89602,"runMs":51765,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":2,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":3},"dropped":35}}
